# evolve step 1: never in an image (secrets, data, local tooling); the image installs its own node_modules.
# ** patterns also catch nested checkouts (e.g. .claude/worktrees/*) that would bring their own server/data (CLI credentials, uploads, anchors).
**/node_modules
.env*
**/.env*
**/server/data
**/backups
**/.superpowers
**/.git
.claude
**/.claude
update/
web/dist
**/*.dump
# deviation from the step-1 brief's list (controller ruling 2026-11-26): screenshots in the docs only; tests read web/docs/improve text and json, never these
web/docs/screenshots
web/docs/**/*.png
web/docs/**/*.jpg
